# L §2.5: "A movement's fields are its legs, its declared attributes and the built-in fields day, kind, fulfils
# (§5.14)"; version, source, known, governs, held, assumed and at are meta's (§3.7), not a movement's: LOAD-FIELD.
# (Writer 6: was REFCORE-UNSPECIFIED §2.2.)
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input gift_day: date

move gift: transfers
  on gift_day
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 10 PLN "s"
  gift_day = 2026-03-01 "s"
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

ask q: count(g in transfers over 2026 where g.known <= 2026-06-30)
=== expect
refused: LOAD-FIELD known is not a field of transfers ...
